+- Tests: apply_test.go, workiva_test.go (new), plan_test.go.
+
+## Must-fix from T5 review
+- workiva_test.go has TestMain that replaces newWorkiva with a guard returning errRealClientInTest, so no test can build the real client or reach the network, even with credentials in the environment. TestNewWorkivaSeamIsFakedInTests asserts the guard. The credentials test calls newLiveWorkivaFromEnv with a fake getenv map, never the process environment.
