+- grep acceptance for /sections, MethodDelete, GetSheetDataTyped: exit 0.
+- lint `test -z "$(gofmt -l .)" && go vet ./... && golangci-lint run`: exit 0, 0 issues.
+- `go build ./...`: exit 0.
